<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n4562" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλμ-η</span></b> , ἡ, (<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἅλς</span>) <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>sea-water, brine,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				5.53
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				2.80
			</span></i>, etc.; <i>spray that has dried on the skin,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Od.
				6.219
			</span></i>; <i>salt incrustation</i> on soil, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.12
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b> after <i><span class="en">
				Hom.
			</span></i>, <i>brine,</i> i.e. <i>the sea,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				Arion
			</span></i> l.<i><span class="en">
				3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pi.
				<u>P.</u>
				4.39
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				397
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Tim.
				<u>Pers.</u>
				96
			</span></i>, etc. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>3.</b>
			<i>salt-water, brine</i> used for pickling, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.77
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Ar.
				<u>V.</u>
				1515
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				<u>Fr.</u>
				416
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἡ Θασία ἅ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cratin.
					6
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἐν ἅλμῃ ἕψειν [τὸν ἰχθύν]</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Antiph.
					222
				</span></i>
			, cf.<i><span class="en">
				Eub.
				44
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">καταπνίγειν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Sotad.Com.
					1.21
				</span></i>
			, etc.: prov., <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρὶν τοὺς ἰχθῦς
				ἑλεῖν σὺ τὴν ἅλμην κυκᾷς</span> 'first catch your
			hare, then cook it', <i><span class="en">
				Phot.
			</span></i>
			
				s.v.
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">πρίν.</span>
			
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>saltness,</i> esp. as a bad quality in soil, <i><span class="en">
				X.
				<u>Oec.</u>
				20.12
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Thphr.
				<u>CP</u>
				6.10.4
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>salt soil,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				PLond.
				2.267.95
			</span></i>, al. <span class="entity">(i/ii A. D.)</span>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
